The Bcore, black-reflection and compiler modules are derived from this
snapshot. Dual Space modifies Google installation, identity persistence,
identifier hooks, disables log uploads, and generates the fallback DEX.
Unused placeholder authentication/token proxies were removed. Guest binding
does not fall back to a different virtual user's package data.

Upstream credits: VirtualApp (asLody), VirtualAPK (didi), Dobby (jmpews),
xDL (hexhacking), BlackReflection (CodingGay), FreeReflection (tiann).
Native Dobby static archives and xDL source are retained from upstream.
